{"id":"o_fter","lemma":"öfter","pos":"adv","rank":1616,"glosses":["ofttimes, from time to time"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/De-%C3%B6fter.ogg/De-%C3%B6fter.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Du solltest deine Eltern öfter anrufen.","en":"You should call your parents more often.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"parents"},null,{"g":"to call, to ring"}]},{"text":"Machst du das öfter?","en":"Do you do this often?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/789624","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Ich wünschte, er würde öfter schreiben.","en":"I wish he would write more often.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wish for","l":"wünschen"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"dignity"},null,{"g":"to write, to write out"}]},{"text":"Das muß ich öfter tun.","en":"I should do that more often.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Wir sollten öfter herkommen.","en":"We should come here more often.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},null,{"g":"to come over"}]}]}